#NEXUS

[ meso2024a_fig7: Alvarezsaurian time tree, read by eye at 3-4x; the ladder from Ceratonykus to Xixianykus steps in short coloured segments, each read as a node. The open circles mark nodes and are not encoded; no clade names are printed. One three-way node: Ondogurvel-Albinykus-Xixianykus (the stem enters at Albinykus's level and runs on as its branch, read as entering the node, as in earlier batches). 23 tips, 1 polytomies (3 children). Sample 6 case (census 2 extended to draw 120, seed 20261231). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

